  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill, since it has front matter, so `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow` applies to it. The requirement says the skill must open with its workflow as ordered steps, before any other section.\n\n- After the front matter, the file has the H1 `# Habeas requirements` and a short intro paragraph. That paragraph sits under the title and is not a section.\n- The first `##` section is `## Workflow`. The sections that follow it (`Writing chapters`, `Choosing references`, `What the review checks`, `Gotchas`) all come after it.\n- The Workflow section is a numbered checklist, `- [ ] 1.` through `- [ ] 7.`, in the order the steps are done. Step 1 hands off to step 6 and step 7 hands off to the habeas-evidence skill.\n- The Workflow text has no obligation this site breaks. The prose after the list is not a section before the workflow.\n\nNo violation queries were listed for this site. I found no gap and no `{fixme}` is needed.",
